{"_id":"4HmUOZBldJVpU3di","name":"Greater Mutations","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","results":[{"_id":"8zJDYwhuhbqQ4M0E","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Arms of the Arheobear! - extend arm(s) to reach to ankles, knotted with muscle. Roll [[/roll 1d6]], 1-3 = one arm, 4-6 = all arms. +[[/roll 1d6]] damage with melee weapons wielded with affected arm.","name":""},{"_id":"giiCuIQmpv9AP7n6","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Bestial Head - the twist's head turns into that of an animal or an alien.","name":""},{"_id":"lJvic4vhu6gnMR3E","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Boneless - the twist develops flexible bones, cartilage and viscera; halves all damage received from weapons, can squeeze through spaces 15cm in diameter. Can distend jaw to swallow unconscious or bound victims whole.","name":""},{"_id":"8JpjPbNDBo8nli21","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Blood Rage - the twist is subject to frenzy, doubling its weapon skill when instigating attacks but halving it when attacked.","name":""},{"_id":"Hzo7OK9LAXdmxbpf","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Breathes Miasma - once per round, as an extra attack action, the twist spews caustic vomit at an engaged opponent, inflicting [[/roll 1d6+3]] stamina damage that ignores armour.","name":""},{"_id":"5ZCggnaoNA2fenYe","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Warp Spawn - gains an additional [[/roll 1d3]] greater mutations.","name":""},{"_id":"JQSzJ3XoLxsB50ut","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[7,7],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Champion of arms - endowed with surpassing ferocity by the warp: +2 actions per round.","name":""},{"_id":"9cD7GiJU0IbJALi3","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[8,8],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Evil Eye - an extra eye in the forehead glowing with sickly light that scours and ruptures all it regards. Once per round, as an extra attack action, the twist may make a gaze attack, inflicting [[/roll 1d6+3]] stamina damage that ignores armour.","name":""},{"_id":"cnNBcVjQDNGlCY3Q","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[9,9],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Flyer - the twist is endowed with a functioning pair of wings they may glide or fly with.","name":""},{"_id":"2qqSfZGbB6Rd6n0O","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[10,10],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Gaping Maw - a cavernous, toothy mouth in the centre of the torso. An opponent inflicting a successful melee attack against this twist must make a successful dodge roll or be bitten for [[/roll 2d6]] stamina damage.","name":""},{"_id":"d7Pe7Y3BnJ06lijz","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[11,11],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Giant - the twist grows double in size and eight times the mass, with +2 to attack skill rolls, +[[/roll 1d6]] to damage rolls and +12 stamina.","name":""},{"_id":"SRc67Jjf2CdO5oih","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[12,12],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Great Horns - may charge, attacking one opponent for [[/roll 3d6]] stamina damage.","name":""},{"_id":"HHnT2ie1zkXjVbH2","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[13,13],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Hideous Appearance - endowed with a visage so horrific even aliens unused to human forms become uneasy. Torso and limbs composed of writhing tentacles, flesh putrid and rotting, hundreds of eyes and mouths, a voice that whispers the torment of a thousand screaming children - all in one twist, for example. The GM is encouraged to play this for all it is worth. Double adventuring skill total for Intimidate rolls.","name":""},{"_id":"utxVrOWc3QdN7moh","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[14,14],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Horrible Stench - generates noxious body odour that can be smelled from the next field. Halve adventuring skill attempts at stealth and any social interaction except Intimidate.","name":""},{"_id":"MbhVUQBfD3W8Fbod","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[15,15],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Leaper - grows prodigiously muscled legs. Can leap during action.","name":""},{"_id":"3z1XsrE6TQPbMVhA","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[16,16],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Multiple Arms - the twist grows [[/roll 1d3]] extra arms and gains 1 extra attack action per round.","name":""},{"_id":"2ftr9LzzLAUiu8iE","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[17,17],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Multiple Heads - the twist gains an additional head that chatters and bleats continually. When coordinated, gains an additional attack action per round. If one head can be distracted, thwarted or otherwise disengaged from its task the twist will fall into argument with itself, becoming unresponsive to anything other than life threatening circumstances for [[/roll 3d6]] minutes.","name":""},{"_id":"nPSpY32n7GaHH0N0","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[18,18],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Poisonous Bite - the twist's bite is venomous doing [[/roll 1d2]] stamina damage and with the Poisonous quality.","name":""},{"_id":"AnF7LeVKvA6tO5jo","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[19,19],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Prehensile Tail - capable of wielding a weapon, +1 attack action per round.","name":""},{"_id":"vKVU9zIaSdFDFAON","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[20,20],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Blessed of the warp - the twist immediately gains access to [[/roll 1d6]] warp glyphs, and their warp focus skill increases by [[/roll 1d6]].","name":""}],"formula":"1d20","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"ownership":{"default":0,"ZtfDqSvKTGtngaYG":3},"description":""}
{"_id":"AOG6LVsoaumRP9PT","name":"Lesser Mutations","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","results":[{"_id":"usroichK240tKBuq","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Bestial Legs - legs transform to be fully bestial.","name":""},{"_id":"Rf4FZNIQMvfjWDGW","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Cadaverous - the twist appears emaciated, halving adventuring Athletics and Endurance skills and suffering -1 to melee damage rolls.","name":""},{"_id":"RWazV3d6Q5yegvoG","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Colour - the twist gains unusual pigmentation of skin or fur. Roll [[/roll 1d6]] - 1: Albino, 2: Jet Black, 3: Sickly Green, 4: Blood Red, 5: Deep Purple, 6: Sky Blue.","name":""},{"_id":"hu26vwTlPyEu1i1K","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Crest - Wattle or crest instead of hair on head. Cosmetic.","name":""},{"_id":"csVOTMNaPzZ7qiHX","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Eye Stalks - [[/roll 3d6]] inches long. Cosmetic.","name":""},{"_id":"ddk17ur6WIGvNf5d","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Great Jaws - and savage teeth. May bite as its attack action for [[/roll 1d6]] stamina damage.","name":""},{"_id":"hCaPzG6r1XMwMqHi","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[7,7],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Headless - head sinks slowly into the chest. Any critical strike to the head is ignored.","name":""},{"_id":"qekWQX9Rn6WhKvTL","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[8,8],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Hunchback - severe kyphosis. Cosmetic","name":""},{"_id":"YEVPfwoGwnFZY4FI","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[9,9],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Huge Head - grows twice the size of normal, often ridged or horned. May headbutt as its attack action for [[/roll 1d6]] damage.","name":""},{"_id":"A6CMT8tWekkRhXSR","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[10,10],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Long neck - becomes 60 cm in length. Roll [[/roll 1d6]]: 1-3 = rigid, 4-6 = flexible.","name":""},{"_id":"7CEofzF4NFIejb8V","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[11,11],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"One eye - eyes fuse to a singular, cycloptic eye. Halve ranged attack roll results.","name":""},{"_id":"ceMiAwDIgklYcNIP","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[12,12],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"One leg - Legs fuse, the twist can hop at half speed, moving 2m as part of its action.","name":""},{"_id":"awPMyPsQ5eyWrMUO","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[13,13],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Pin Head - sever microcephaly. Halves all weapon and adventuring skill roll results.","name":""},{"_id":"pWJynfn8rdxmMTSs","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[14,14],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Quadraped - Arms extend to knees, twist may move on all fours.","name":""},{"_id":"FS43eY7fciqcT4kd","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[15,15],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Rearranged limbs - Legs and arms swap. twist halves weapon and adventuring skill test results that require balance or gross motor competency.","name":""},{"_id":"FJRTQAwBIyD0wYmT","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[16,16],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Tentacle arms - prehensile, cosmetic.","name":""},{"_id":"n2M3xixymhb40yfH","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[17,17],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Third eye - roll [[/roll 1d6]] for location: 1: head, 2: arm, 3: torso, 4: groin, 5: buttock, 6: leg. Cosmetic.","name":""},{"_id":"isaBqHg7u9csxLkM","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[18,18],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Tough skin - developes +1 armour. Roll [[/roll 1d6]] for type: 1: chitin, 2: quills, 3: dense fur, 4: thick leathery hide, 5: scales, 6: rubbery flesh.","name":""},{"_id":"sLBWiGcPgExvZ8jy","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[19,19],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Marked by the warp - roll twice more on this table.","name":""},{"_id":"pXm1ZiqB5UzUIo2M","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[20,20],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Chosen of the warp - roll once on the greater mutations table.","name":""}],"formula":"1d20","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"ownership":{"default":0,"ZtfDqSvKTGtngaYG":3},"description":""}
{"_id":"JOgjUBGRbKWihwU6","name":"Critical - Crushing","img":"icons/svg/skull.svg","results":[{"_id":"uQccnOm1qQoVTE7C","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"A rap on the skull sends teeth chattering, dazed for [[/roll 1d6]] rounds.","name":""},{"_id":"Aqv083gaBhGlcRr6","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Foot crushed, hops around in agony for [[/roll 1d6]] rounds.","name":""},{"_id":"5yeATTyQ6kYdL33m","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"Dead leg, all tests involving movement at a penalty of -3 for [[/roll 1d3]] days.","name":""},{"_id":"aWQMCSTnIJ5FNvXZ","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"description":"A whack in the guts, winded and wheezing, can only defend at a penalty of -3 for [[/roll 1d6]] rounds.","name":""},{"_id":"0RSzMl4a6dKnJX1r","type":"text","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{},"img":"icons/svg/d20-black.svg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"